Package: orphan-watchdog
Version: 1.0.4
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Thy <thy@local>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.8), systemd
Description: Autonomous watchdog and MCP process supervisor for Linux workstations
 Protects desktop workstations from runaway orphaned background processes,
 broken pipe spin-loops, and orphaned MCP servers. Designed for Ubuntu 24.04 LTS
 and higher.
